    "title": "Type 2 Diabetes - Symptoms",
    "content": "Topic: Type 2 Diabetes\nSection: Symptoms\nPublisher: National Library of Medicine (NLM/NIH)\n\nCommon symptoms of type 2 diabetes include increased thirst (polydipsia), frequent urination (polyuria), increased hunger (polyphagia), unexplained weight loss, fatigue, blurred vision, slow-healing sores, and frequent infections.",
