    "title": "Tuberculosis (TB) - Diagnosis",
    "content": "Topic: Tuberculosis (TB)\nSection: Diagnosis\nPublisher: National Library of Medicine (NLM/NIH)\n\nDiagnostic evaluation includes sputum smear microscopy for Acid-Fast Bacilli (AFB), molecular diagnostic testing (Cartridge-Based Nucleic Acid Amplification Test / CBNAAT / GeneXpert), chest radiography, and mycobacterial culture.",
